  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 1.41,
      "e": 3.82,
      "text": "- HFGCS is important to the Air Force's mission"
    },
    {
      "s": 3.82,
      "e": 7.36,
      "text": "because we monitor our station 365 days a year, 24/7,"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.36,
      "e": 9.7,
      "text": "providing support and communications"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.7,
      "e": 11.61,
      "text": "to the president United States, Secretary of Defense,"
    },
    {
      "s": 11.61,
      "e": 15.63,
      "text": "all DOD agencies including support for NASA, SpaceX,"
    },
    {
      "s": 15.63,
      "e": 17.03,
      "text": "and Nuclear Command Control."
    },
    {
      "s": 18.13,
      "e": 20.64,
      "text": "So in HFGCS we provide many capabilities"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.64,
      "e": 23.21,
      "text": "and one of them is clean phone patches."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.21,
      "e": 24.23,
      "text": "During a phone patch,"
    },
    {
      "s": 24.23,
      "e": 27.43,
      "text": "we can link any aircraft in the air anytime"
    },
    {
      "s": 27.43,
      "e": 30.39,
      "text": "to anywhere on the ground that has HF capabilities"
    },
    {
      "s": 30.39,
      "e": 32.48,
      "text": "through our system and our circuits."
    },
    {
      "s": 33.5,
      "e": 34.81,
      "text": "One of the most important phone patches"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.81,
      "e": 37.95,
      "text": "I think I've experienced is at the B1B Lancer"
    },
    {
      "s": 37.95,
      "e": 40.43,
      "text": "out of Ellsworth Air Force base in South Dakota,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.43,
      "e": 42.91,
      "text": "who was leaking hydraulic fluid over the Pacific ocean."
    },
    {
      "s": 42.91,
      "e": 45.95,
      "text": "They needed weather updates and the phone patch"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.95,
      "e": 48.81,
      "text": "was important because we were able to ensure the safety"
    },
    {
      "s": 48.81,
      "e": 51.27,
      "text": "of our crew members on board of the bomber."
    },
    {
      "s": 51.27,
      "e": 53.09,
      "text": "Retrieved a weather report"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.09,
      "e": 55.9,
      "text": "and they made emergency landing at Beale Air Force Base."
    }
  ],
